                                          rdfs:subClassOf <https://purl.dsmz.de/schema/MISO_1_4> ;
                                          rdfs:description "In situ bioremediation environments are sites where bioremediation processes occur at the original site of contamination."@en ;
                                          rdfs:label "In situ"@en ;
                                          skos:example "In situ colonization system deployed in a hydrothermal diffusing flow (maximum temperature of 78°C)" .


###  https://purl.dsmz.de/schema/MISO_1_4_304
